1
00:00:00,290 --> 00:00:04,670
Operation theatre mein doctor green ya blue hi kyun pehente hain, white kyun nahi?

2
00:00:04,670 --> 00:00:13,980
Ek test karo: is laal dot ko kuch second ghoor ke dekho.

3
00:00:13,980 --> 00:00:16,390
Ab safed screen dekho. Hara dhabba dikha na?

4
00:00:16,390 --> 00:00:19,140
Surgery mein doctor ghanton laal khoon dekhte hain.

5
00:00:19,140 --> 00:00:25,670
Agar kapde aur deewarein safed hon, toh nazar hatate hi aise hare dhabbe dikhne lagte hain, aur dhyaan bhatak sakta hai.

6
00:00:25,670 --> 00:00:28,650
Par green ya blue kapdon pe yeh dhabbe chhup jaate hain.

7
00:00:28,650 --> 00:00:32,170
Aur hara rang aankhon ko laal ke liye dobara fresh kar deta hai.

8
00:00:32,170 --> 00:00:36,710
Upar se, tez lights mein safed kapde chamakte hain aur aankhon ko thakaate hain.

9
00:00:36,710 --> 00:00:39,810
Toh rang style nahi, doctor ki nazar ki safety hai.

10
00:00:39,810 --> 00:00:44,410
Aise roz ke "kyun" ke liye Whysplained ko subscribe karo!
